.TH std::queue::push 3 "2026.11.10" "http://cppreference.com" "C++ Standard Libary"
.SH NAME
std::queue::push \- std::queue::push

.SH Synopsis
void push( const value_type& value ); \fB(1)\fP
void push( value_type&& value );      \fB(2)\fP \fI(since C++11)\fP

Pushes the given element value to the end of the queue.

1) Equivalent to: c.push_back(value).
2) Equivalent to: c.push_back(std::move(value)).

.SH Parameters

value - the value of the element to push

.SH Return value

\fI(none)\fP

.SH Complexity

Equal to the complexity of Container::push_back.

